      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "IL2CPP does not check the division of zero by default.\nThat may be why it's crashing like this time.\nhttps://twitter.com/mkc1370/status/1266523946750341120\nUnity - Manual: Compiler options\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/IL2CPP-CompilerOptions.html",
